@switch INTERACT_VERB
@case "look"
	@if not is_dragon()
		She looks angry.
	@else
		She towers over you and regards you with disdain.
@case "talk to"
	@if not is_dragon()
		Humans can't understand dragons.
	@else
		@switch flag_count("dragon_talk")
		@case 0
			"This is not how you expected this to go, is it?"
			"Such a fate was inevitable for someone like you."
			"You are ruled by your pride, and you saw yourself above consequences."
			She glares in disgust.
			"Do you wish to know how to undo this curse?"
			"I will tell you no such thing."
			"Live with the path you have set yourself upon."
			@do give_flag "dragon_talk"
		@case 1
			"I have nothing more to say to you."
@case "kill"
	You're going to need to be more specific than that.
@case "throw rock at"
	[placeholder you are so fucking dead]
@case else
	Cannot do.
